  "final_answer": "I have completed the task successfully. Let me provide the final answer.\n\n## Summary\n\n### Specialization Found\nI found a Specialization about **Project Management** (项目管理 专项课程) on Coursera, produced by **University of Colorado Boulder**.\n\n**Key details:**\n- **Title**: Project Management Specialization\n- **Provider**: University of Colorado Boulder\n- **Instructor**: Christy Bozic, PhD, PMP\n- **Rating**: 4.7 stars (1,564 reviews)\n- **Enrolled students**: 43,733\n- **Level**: Beginner\n- **Duration**: ~4 weeks at 10 hours/week\n- **Series of 3 courses**:\n  1. Project Management: Foundations and Initiation\n  2. Project Planning and Execution\n  3. Agile Project Management\n- **URL**: https://www.coursera.org/specializations/meem-project-management\n\n### Testimonial for the Specialization\n\nThe Specialization page displays testimonials on its #testimonials section. Here are testimonials from students:\n\n**Felipe M.** (Student since 2018):\n> \"能够按照自己的速度和节奏学习课程是一次很棒的经历。只要符合自己的时间表和心情，我就可以学习。\"\n> \n> *(English: \"Being able to take courses at my own pace and rhythm was a great experience. As long as it fits my schedule and mood, I can study.\")*\n\n**Jennifer J.** (Student since 2020):\n> \"我直接将从课程中学到的概念和技能应用到一个令人兴奋的新工作项目中。\"\n>\n> *(English: \"I directly applied concepts and skills from the course to an exciting new work project.\")*\n\n**Larry W.** (Student since 2021):\n> \"如果我的大学不提供我需要的主题课程，Coursera 便是最好的去处之一。\"\n>\n> *(English: \"If my university doesn't offer the topical courses I need, Coursera is one of the best places to go.\")*\n\n### Specific Student Reviews for the Specialization\n\nThe Specialization also has direct student course reviews displayed:\n- **JE** (Dec 28, 2022) — Project Management: Foundations and Initiation — **5.0 stars**: *\"Great info. Only suggestions would be to have 1080p+ resolution for videos and a dark mode for easier viewing late night studying. Thank you.\"*\n- **LQ** (Jun 6, 2023) — Project Planning and Execution — **4.0 stars**: *\"It failed a few times before it finally verified.\"*\n- **SP** (Aug 7, 2023) — Agile Project Management — **5.0 stars**: *\"Thank you for making me understand the fundamental...\"*\n\n**Note**: The page was displayed in Chinese due to system locale detection, but the content (course title, university, instructor names, testimonial images of students) is the same as the English version.",
